  "html": "<p><br/>\n</p>\n<table style=\"background: transparent;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid red; padding: 12px; margin: 10; background-color: lightgoldenrodyellow;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"100%\">\n<center><div style=\"float\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/DRLogoLayeredScaled.gif\" title=\"DRLogoLayeredScaled.gif\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" height=\"66\" src=\"/images/DRLogoLayeredScaled.gif\" width=\"200\"/></a><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Maintitle.png\" title=\"Image:maintitle.png\"><img alt=\"Image:maintitle.png\" border=\"0\" height=\"36\" src=\"/images/Maintitle.png\" width=\"548\"/></a><br/></div></center><br/>\n<p><b>The Townstons is a Fansite wiki. Here you can find information and opinions from lots of players of the popular game Dungeon Runners!  You can start increasing your knowledge by clicking on one of the categories below or on the menu to the left.  They all contain valuable information which has been contributed by players like YOU! </b>\n</p>\n<ul><li><big><b>Here is the <a href=\"/wiki/FAQ\" title=\"FAQ\">FAQ</a> which explains all about how this Wiki works.</b></big>\n</li></ul>\n<ul><li><b>Here is the <a href=\"/wiki/Crew\" title=\"Crew\">Crew</a> Page which lists the moderators.</b>\n</li><li><b>The MOST important people in this Wiki are YOU, the players and contributors!</b>\n</li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<table style=\"background: transparent;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"border: 1px solid blue; padding: 12px; margin: 10; background-color: bisque;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"50%\">\n<center><div style=\"float\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Maintopics.png\" title=\"Image:Maintopics.png\"><img alt=\"Image:Maintopics.png\" border=\"0\" height=\"60\" src=\"/images/Maintopics.png\" width=\"350\"/></a><br/></div></center><br/>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<pre> *<b><a href=\"/wiki/Newbies_Start_Here\" title=\"Newbies Start Here\">Newbies Start Here</a>:</b>  <i>The beginners pages.</i>\n</pre>\n<pre> *<b><font color=\"red\">NEW!</font>  <a href=\"/wiki/Screenshots\" title=\"Screenshots\">Screenshots</a>:</b> <i>Post your pictures here!</i>\n</pre>\n<ul><li><b><a href=\"/wiki/Dungeons\" title=\"Dungeons\">Dungeons</a>:</b> <i>Schematic maps, outlines and details of all dungeons</i>\n</li></ul>\n<ul><li><b><a href=\"/wiki/Guides\" title=\"Guides\">Guides</a>:</b> <i>Useful information including Interface Guide, Boss Guides, Tips and other stuff.</i>\n</li></ul>\n<ul><li><b><a href=\"/wiki/Skills\" title=\"Skills\">Skills</a>:</b> <i> Information on the effects and costs of all skills.</i>\n</li></ul>\n<ul><li><b><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Monsters\" title=\"Category:Monsters\">Monsters:</a></b> <i>Descriptions, often pictures, and sometimes tips for all monsters</i>\n</li></ul>\n<ul><li><b><a href=\"/wiki/Items\" title=\"Items\">Items</a>:</b> <i>Weapons, Armor, Jewelry and their uses, with a special section on <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Rainbow_items\" title=\"Category:Rainbow items\">Mythic (Rainbow) Items</a>.</i>\n</li></ul>\n<ul><li><b><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Quests\" title=\"Category:Quests\">Quests</a>:</b> <i>The Quests that make the game interesting.</i>\n</li></ul>\n<ul><li><b><a href=\"/wiki/Category:NPC's\" title=\"Category:NPC's\">NPC's</a>:</b> <i>Non Player Characters and Objects you will encounter.</i>\n</li></ul>\n<ul><li><b><a href=\"/wiki/Towns/Outposts\" title=\"Towns/Outposts\">Towns/Outposts</a>:</b> <i>The places in the game that are NOT dungeons!</i>\n</li></ul>\n<ul><li><b><a href=\"/wiki/Builds\" title=\"Builds\">Builds</a>:</b> <i>Share experience on how to create the perfect character.</i>\n</li></ul>\n<ul><li><b><a href=\"/wiki/Game_Mechanics\" title=\"Game Mechanics\">Game Mechanics</a>:</b> <i>Those all important formulae and calculations, and a <a href=\"/wiki/List_of_Equations\" title=\"List of Equations\">List of Equations</a>.</i>\n</li></ul>\n<ul><li><b><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Guilds\" title=\"Category:Guilds\">Guilds (Posses)</a>:</b> <i>Groups of players working together cooperatively.</i>\n</li></ul>\n<ul><li><b><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Glossary\" title=\"Category:Glossary\">Glossary</a>:</b> <i>Definitions of game terms, many with links to more extensive articles.</i>\n</li></ul>\n<ul><li><b><a href=\"/wiki/Category:PvP\" title=\"Category:PvP\">PvP</a>:</b> <i>Everything about Player vs. Player combat.</i>\n</li></ul>\n</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid blue; padding: 12px; margin: 10; background-color: #f0f0ff;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"100%\">\n<center><div style=\"float\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Contributor.png\" title=\"Image:Contributor.png\"><img alt=\"Image:Contributor.png\" border=\"0\" height=\"60\" src=\"/images/Contributor.png\" width=\"350\"/></a><br/></div></center><br/>\n<p><big><b>Players like YOU make this wiki successful!</b></big><br/>\n</p><p><b>Register:</b> To be able to edit pages and have access to more pages which are unviewable for anonymous users you can register <b><a href=\"/wiki/Special:Userlogin\" title=\"Special:Userlogin\">Here!</a></b>\n</p><p><b>Editing a Page:</b>  If you are reading a page and have something useful to add, or a correction to make, look for the EDIT tab at the top of the page. Click it, and you will be able to make your additions or changes.<br/>\n</p><p><b>Creating a new page:</b>  See <big><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Page_Entry_Guides\" title=\"Category:Page Entry Guides\">Page Entry Guides</a></big> for easy entry templates for pages on Quests, Monsters, NPC's, Guilds and Rainbow Items.  Or you can simply type in the name of the article you wish to create and click the \"Create Article\" button.  If the article doesn't exist, it will immediately put you into the editor.\n</p>\n<div align=\"center\" class=\"createbox\">\n<p><form action=\"/thetownstons/index.php\" class=\"createboxForm\" method=\"get\" name=\"createbox\">\n<input name=\"action\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"create\"/>\n<input name=\"prefix\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"\"/>\n<input name=\"preload\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"\"/>\n<input name=\"editintro\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"\"/>\n<input class=\"createboxInput\" name=\"title\" size=\"0\" type=\"text\" value=\"\"/>\n<input class=\"createboxButton\" name=\"create\" type=\"submit\" value=\"Create Article\"/>\n</form></p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p><p><b>Getting Started:</b>  For people that are new with contributing at a wiki, there is a small guide that will explain everything about the \"Code\" of wiki pages (Text make up, pasting an image etc.) <big><a href=\"/wiki/Wiki_Guide\" title=\"Wiki Guide\">Beginner's Guide Click here!</a></big>.  If you don't want to do the coding, just type your article in plain text, and one of the mods will check it and may add the links and frills to it.\n<br/><br/>\n</p>\n</td></tr></table>\n<table style=\"background: transparent;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"border: 1px solid blue; padding: 12px; margin: 10; background-color: bisque;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"50%\">\n<center><div style=\"float\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Wikinews.png\" title=\"Image:Wikinews.png\"><img alt=\"Image:Wikinews.png\" border=\"0\" height=\"60\" src=\"/images/Wikinews.png\" width=\"350\"/></a><br/></div></center><br/>\n<p><b>15 January 2009:  <a href=\"/wiki/Main_Page/news\" title=\"Main Page/news\">News Message</a></b> <a href=\"/wiki/Category:PvP\" title=\"Category:PvP\">PvP</a> Category added! Contributions from PvP'ers needed!\n</p><p><b>8 January 2009:  <a href=\"/wiki/Main_Page/news\" title=\"Main Page/news\">News Message</a></b>  Build 155 New Skills being added<br/>\n</p><p><b>26 September 2008:  <a href=\"/wiki/Main_Page/news\" title=\"Main Page/news\">News Message</a></b>  Chunk 4 UPDATE Progress<br/>\n</p><p><b>12 July 2008:  <a href=\"/wiki/Main_Page/news\" title=\"Main Page/news\">News Message</a></b>  The new Chunk, loads of info!<br/>\n</p><p><b>28 May 2008:  <a href=\"/wiki/Main_Page/news\" title=\"Main Page/news\">News Message</a></b>  The Townstons Forums are up!<br/>\n</p><p><b>16 May 2008:  <a href=\"/wiki/Main_Page/news\" title=\"Main Page/news\">News Message</a></b>  Heave 121 Updates in Progress.<br/>\n</p><p><b>8 May 2008: <a href=\"/wiki/Main_Page/news\" title=\"Main Page/news\">News Message</a></b> Upcoming Major Updates.<br/>\n</p><p><b>5 March 2008: <a href=\"/wiki/Main_Page/news\" title=\"Main Page/news\">News Message</a></b> The Stiki Wiki Hot-Glue Gun<br/>\n</p><p><b>4 March 2008: <a href=\"/wiki/Main_Page/news\" title=\"Main Page/news\">News Message</a></b> New Additions<br/>\n</p><p><b>28 February 2008: <a href=\"/wiki/Main_Page/news\" title=\"Main Page/news\">News Message</a></b> Guides updated<br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid blue; padding: 12px; margin: 10; background-color: #f0f0ff;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"100%\">\n<center><div style=\"float\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Poll.png\" title=\"Image:Poll.png\"><img alt=\"Image:Poll.png\" border=\"0\" height=\"60\" src=\"/images/Poll.png\" width=\"350\"/></a><br/></div></center><br/>\n<br/><table cellpadding=\"5\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border:1px outset\"><tr><td bgcolor=\"transparent\"><a name=\"firstone\"></a><a id=\"5CC1BBEE8051B057A701EED9718362CD\" name=\"5CC1BBEE8051B057A701EED9718362CD\"></a><b>What is the BEST BUILD for a player Levels 1-20? </b><font size=\"1\">(221 votes)</font><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr style=\"line-height: 100%\"><td bgcolor=\"transparent\"><form action=\"#5CC1BBEE8051B057A701EED9718362CD\" method=\"POST\" name=\"poll\"><input name=\"poll_ID\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"5CC1BBEE8051B057A701EED9718362CD\"/><input name=\"answer\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"2\"/><input align=\"texttop\" alt=\"Vote\" height=\"20\" name=\"Vote\" src=\"/thetownstons/extensions/Poll/images/button.gif\" type=\"image\" width=\"23\"/> Fighters Rule!  </form></td><td bgcolor=\"transparent\" width=\"160\"><font size=\"1\"><img height=\"10\" src=\"/thetownstons/extensions/Poll/images/lefta.gif\" width=\"4\"/><img alt=\"72 votes\" height=\"10\" src=\"/thetownstons/extensions/Poll/images/middlea.gif\" width=\"33\"/><img height=\"10\" src=\"/thetownstons/extensions/Poll/images/righta.gif\" width=\"5\"/> 33% </font></td></tr><tr style=\"line-height: 100%\"><td bgcolor=\"transparent\"><form action=\"#5CC1BBEE8051B057A701EED9718362CD\" method=\"POST\" name=\"poll\"><input name=\"poll_ID\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"5CC1BBEE8051B057A701EED9718362CD\"/><input name=\"answer\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"3\"/><input align=\"texttop\" alt=\"Vote\" height=\"20\" name=\"Vote\" src=\"/thetownstons/extensions/Poll/images/button.gif\" type=\"image\" width=\"23\"/> Mages Forever!  </form></td><td bgcolor=\"transparent\" width=\"160\"><font size=\"1\"><img height=\"10\" src=\"/thetownstons/extensions/Poll/images/lefta.gif\" width=\"4\"/><img alt=\"113 votes\" height=\"10\" src=\"/thetownstons/extensions/Poll/images/middlea.gif\" width=\"51\"/><img height=\"10\" src=\"/thetownstons/extensions/Poll/images/righta.gif\" width=\"5\"/> 51% </font></td></tr><tr style=\"line-height: 100%\"><td bgcolor=\"transparent\"><form action=\"#5CC1BBEE8051B057A701EED9718362CD\" method=\"POST\" name=\"poll\"><input name=\"poll_ID\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"5CC1BBEE8051B057A701EED9718362CD\"/><input name=\"answer\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"4\"/><input align=\"texttop\" alt=\"Vote\" height=\"20\" name=\"Vote\" src=\"/thetownstons/extensions/Poll/images/button.gif\" type=\"image\" width=\"23\"/> Rangers Rock!  </form></td><td bgcolor=\"transparent\" width=\"160\"><font size=\"1\"><img height=\"10\" src=\"/thetownstons/extensions/Poll/images/lefta.gif\" width=\"4\"/><img alt=\"23 votes\" height=\"10\" src=\"/thetownstons/extensions/Poll/images/middlea.gif\" width=\"10\"/><img height=\"10\" src=\"/thetownstons/extensions/Poll/images/righta.gif\" width=\"5\"/> 10% </font></td></tr><tr style=\"line-height: 100%\"><td bgcolor=\"transparent\"><form action=\"#5CC1BBEE80